      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `7f9b3c7b18151f0914ef9a510e049ba35e59711c96e32ed8f82e3778cda13999--employee-earnings-and-hours-australia-2023-cube-7-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Employee Earnings and Hours, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: May 2023\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | a9860fd439d93e8e1bbf625846c1dec7c6fb9fcc28b7c6d222a31c8934140042 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | a362b380e5dd85080a7f30ede5de7f82b460ca5bd9e43c96c54adf650bc3e4c4 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | c40fa56096a59ac50a8f9b6391c41f65a4303ff169bb0091624747cec6c62127 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | aacd0d924c3d076e3c566f315c4868e09d89fb6965a8831d14605d27ccad404a | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | ef532b21b8cbd9b338b3b2dde84c4315d0a3bc37f856b2d40152a5fc972d7284 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 5dcffe372eaa7e9824e6ce9b6734818075ed606d2e8e481600f21f2b828ee8a9 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 3004344887dc78d95a007c9690a3b342d148de90cb4c81bb542ece96e07b76f8 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
